<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-UHISPANK TAKES TRANCHE FROM BOND ISSUE-REPORT.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-UHISPANK TAKES TRANCHE FROM BOND ISSUE-REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank has accepted 240 million kroons as part of an 800 million kroon international bond issue, Aripaev newspaper said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The agreement for the medium-term note was signed with four international banks on June 2 and has a three-year term and interest based on German mark libor plus eight percent, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
